{"id":"601349","name":"牛肉腊肠焖饭","author":"苇儿WR","authorId":"9963749","desc":"","cover":"images/601349/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腊肠","amount":"2条"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"1块"},{"name":"大米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干香菇","amount":"2个"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芹菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/601349/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"腊肠，牛肉及所有配菜切好，干香菇泡发好。","img":"images/601349/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取适量大米洗净。","img":"images/601349/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入泡香菇的水及适量饮用水。","img":"images/601349/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"水位比平时煮饭略少一点。","img":"images/601349/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅放油爆香姜丝。","img":"images/601349/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入腊肠，牛肉和香菇粒炒香。","img":"images/601349/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入配菜一起翻炒至半熟状态。","img":"images/601349/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"铲出锅铺在电饭煲内的大米上面。","img":"images/601349/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"按煮饭键。","img":"images/601349/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮饭完成后，淋上适量生抽。","img":"images/601349/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"撒一点胡椒粉。","img":"images/601349/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"撒上香菜香葱末，利用余温再焖5分钟。","img":"images/601349/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"分钟后开盖拌匀。","img":"images/601349/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"喷香扑鼻，可以开吃啦，喜欢辣的还可以拌点辣椒酱。","img":"images/601349/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}